Manny Torres, played by Diego Calva.

5
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Nellie LaRoy, played by Margot Robbie.

6
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Jack Conrad, played by Brad Pitt.

7
